# Hero video — legacy progressive-MP4 fallback only (157 MB, over GitHub's
# 100 MB per-file push limit). This is NOT the primary playback path: it's
# used only by browsers with neither native HLS nor Media Source Extensions
# — practically nobody. The real HLS fMP4 assets (public/heros/hls/*.m4s,
# init.mp4, hero.m3u8) ARE tracked in git — every individual file there is
# comfortably under the limit, so `git clone` gets a fully working site.
# This one file must be deployed to production as a manual step alongside
# the rest (see docs/GUIA-INFRAESTRUCTURA-IT.md) instead of via git.
public/heros/hls/hero.mp4
